  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "game-description-5dcc9923-44f9-4272-9f1e-b9a8982bc161-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "The original Assassin’s Creed follows Altaïr through a fictionalized Holy Land during the Third Crusade. Missions combine gathering information, approaching a target, carrying out an assassination, and escaping through streets and rooftops. Climbing and blending into crowds make the city itself part of the player’s toolkit."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-5dcc9923-44f9-4272-9f1e-b9a8982bc161-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "These historical adventures are framed as memories accessed by Desmond Miles through a machine called the Animus. The competing ideals of Assassins and Templars connect the two periods. This 2007 release established the series’ mixture of historical settings, parkour, and conspiracy fiction."
    },
